{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "92bb63db918cd54360147d2667fd198c3f5bce0b03f154461f611e76c1c9394e", "ja": "いや～、今日は朝から楽しかったなぁ、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哎呀～我今天从一早就好开心耶，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "e3f7dd27bd569ec7fbf7be65874c732686619858c4a8bc567764324dcbb242c8", "ja": "あんなお祭りに、たいこ叩いたりするほうで参加できる\nなんて、アイドルになったかいがあったと思うわ。", "zh": "没想到我能在那场祭典上担任打太鼓的成员，\n当偶像真是太值得了啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b0391df834287434fdea1981bafadc2579299aad1e8a7f378053b9e45ca666ed", "ja": "あはは、お客さんにも、奈緒の楽しい気持ちが伝わって\nたと思うぞ。いい笑顔で頑張ってくれて、ありがとう！", "zh": "哈哈，我想观众们也有感受到奈绪的喜悦喔。\n谢谢你带着灿烂笑容卖力演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "34313c53bdc818337dc7616ea3996a0821bca851c0dc6a52be9b052e7dff3a4d", "ja": "{$P$}さんこそ、ごほうびの\nクレープ、おごってくれてありがとうな！", "zh": "我才该谢谢{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你请我吃可丽饼嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "877c962afb59b4e5529721ff0eddbb79e48ab1949df45c1937948c229e9bbb93", "ja": "あの店のんメッチャ美味しかったし、また食べたいわ～\n……って、あれ？　{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "那家店的可丽饼超好吃的，我还想再吃～\n……嗯？哎呀？{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4c93d1fe7a5420d4509777c2da7a9ec788e6880efc4c07152305a0e9c2aef829", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、奈緒？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "23187cffaaf33443399d16d01bf10e326681605c7367c1cf5c30636bd49f8da0", "ja": "ぷぷっ……。ほっぺのここに、クリームついてますよ？\nクレープの、ずっとつけてたんちゃいます？", "zh": "噗噗……你脸颊这里沾到奶油了耶？\n是不是可丽饼的奶油一直沾在那里呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2989d8124302a69741cf23ecdab0bd6884105f405f464a9cc9c4a4509a5bfede", "ja": "えっ、本当か！？　ええと、鏡はどこだ……？", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？呃，镜子在哪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "ecd1d91fb46f3cb182cfccae858cd8bc31899ac77b041aeacab798a670878b71", "ja": "そんなん、私がとった方が早いって！\nちょっとジッとしててな……。", "zh": "我用手帮你擦掉比较快啦！\n你先别动嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "bd2dafea4da0555558369134271ac6a4894a97ef4036bd5e5acb63293c7f3916", "ja": "ん、キレイにとれたわ。…………ごくり。", "zh": "嗯，擦干净啰…………（吞口水）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8935fa49525981959bc264868f8615ecfa7f5ae8646e2f35d58f77ce2c71239c", "ja": "すまなかったな、ありがとう、奈緒！　……奈緒？", "zh": "抱歉啊。谢谢你，奈绪……奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "b447dc2c3a276c8257b736d9fd7eb9ceb99703ded5ae3f17e52a1b21c5cd4e2c", "ja": "……はっ！　な、なめようとか思ってへんで！？\nもったいないなって、ちょっと頭をよぎっただけで。", "zh": "……啊！我、我才没有想要舔喔！？\n只是突然觉得有点浪费而已啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ac787b415270a92de993bf8df15d772cd2e7d13059b24f862dbb03015649b848", "ja": "そんなに気に入ったのか……。じゃあ、顔についてたの\nなんて食べなくても、もう一個買ってきてやるよ。", "zh": "原来你这么喜欢奶油啊……那也用不着吃这种\n沾在脸上的奶油，我再买一个给你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0033_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "a17ced7030fdb9850a48f6e701a378ab9a1d429ce88395450702ef441a7a2902", "ja": "え、ホンマに！？　……じゃあ、このクリームは向こう\nでふいてこよ。た、食べへんよ？　あっちむいといて！", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？那么，这坨奶油就去那里擦掉好了。\n我、我不会吃掉啦～你的脸先转过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
